WEBVTT

00:04.212 --> 00:07.048
<i>The True Demon King has died.</i>

00:07.048 --> 00:10.969
<i>The enemy of the world
was defeated by somebody.</i>

00:10.969 --> 00:16.141
<i>But even now, the powers left behind
writhe in multitude.</i>

00:16.141 --> 00:19.394
<i>They cannot be subdued
by ordinary strength.</i>

00:19.394 --> 00:22.147
<i>A hundred</i> shura<i>-like demons...</i>

00:23.857 --> 00:29.362
<i>The world's largest city, Aureatia,
proceeds with the selection of a Hero,</i>

00:29.362 --> 00:32.949
<i>while the leader
of the New Principality of Lithia,</i>

00:32.949 --> 00:37.954
<i>Taren the Guarded,
seeks new order, and governs through fear.</i>

00:51.676 --> 00:55.055
ISHURA

02:13.842 --> 02:15.426
The heck is all this?

02:15.426 --> 02:20.974
New Principality of Lithia

02:20.974 --> 02:23.977
Man, am I late?

02:24.561 --> 02:27.564
It looks like things have already started.

02:28.231 --> 02:31.401
I'm guessing those folks from Aureatia
won't be able to get through.

02:33.778 --> 02:37.699
Episode 9
Fire From the Sky

02:37.699 --> 02:40.201
Where is the enemy?
Prepare more archers!

02:40.201 --> 02:41.327
Any movement in Aureatia?

02:41.327 --> 02:43.204
Watch out for cavalry charges!

02:43.204 --> 02:44.956
Don't let a single rider through!

02:44.956 --> 02:46.583
Hey!

02:52.005 --> 02:54.007
Can you guys move out of the way?

02:54.007 --> 02:56.593
I doubt you're much fun to fight.

03:02.599 --> 03:03.850
Fire!

03:10.106 --> 03:12.567
Only seven bullets headed for my body.

03:12.567 --> 03:15.028
Why don't you try aiming a bit better?!

03:20.867 --> 03:23.536
Curse you!
Are you an assassin from Aureatia?

03:24.037 --> 03:25.830
I told you to get out of the way.

03:27.290 --> 03:28.374
Huh?

03:47.894 --> 03:49.312
What the heck are you?

03:49.312 --> 03:52.315
I do feel bad about this,

03:52.315 --> 03:54.651
but all of you must die.

03:54.651 --> 03:57.237
I have to clear a path
for everyone, you see.

04:06.412 --> 04:08.081
Use the cannons!

04:08.831 --> 04:11.084
Get word to the patrolling wyverns!

04:11.084 --> 04:13.086
Fire the cannons!

04:25.181 --> 04:27.684
Are the wyvern soldiers
still not here?

04:28.268 --> 04:31.229
I won't be able to clear the path
until I deal with them.

04:31.229 --> 04:32.313
Oy!
- Huh?

04:35.149 --> 04:37.694
Won't you answer me already?

04:38.194 --> 04:40.071
What the heck are you?

04:40.655 --> 04:42.740
I know who you are,

04:42.740 --> 04:44.826
Soujirou the Willow-Sword.

04:45.493 --> 04:47.161
I'm your ally.

04:47.161 --> 04:50.123
That's not what I asked.

04:50.123 --> 04:53.084
I won't let you wreak havoc
all by yourself.

04:53.084 --> 04:55.295
If you want to fight, then fight with me!

04:57.088 --> 04:58.172
Why should I?

04:58.756 --> 05:00.091
Because you're strong!

05:05.179 --> 05:08.182
That speed.
Are you really a minia?

05:08.975 --> 05:10.727
It's in your torso.

05:10.727 --> 05:13.187
I've seen it. Your life.

05:13.187 --> 05:16.190
You only have one life, don't you?

05:16.858 --> 05:20.194
That vehicle and the person riding it
join to make one.

05:21.446 --> 05:24.324
<i>He may be an ally
of Aureatia too...</i>

05:24.324 --> 05:27.160
<i>Wait, that's exactly why he's dangerous.</i>

05:29.078 --> 05:31.247
I have no intention
of fighting with you.

05:31.247 --> 05:33.207
Because I've just about finished...

05:42.425 --> 05:44.552
...taking control of this position.

05:46.220 --> 05:47.638
Hey, wait!

05:48.931 --> 05:50.266
There's nothing for it.

05:50.266 --> 05:53.936
I'll cut down the spider
and the skeleton together.

06:00.610 --> 06:01.611
Huh?

06:05.114 --> 06:06.282
The eye...

06:08.201 --> 06:09.869
From just before, huh?

06:10.453 --> 06:12.830
<i>Not even an ogre's axe</i>

06:12.830 --> 06:16.918
<i>or dragon's breath
can destroy Helneten's armor.</i>

06:16.918 --> 06:18.961
<i>I wonder what kind of sword
he cut me with?</i>

06:20.963 --> 06:22.799
It seems like

06:22.799 --> 06:25.802
there's someone else
who can kill me besides you,

06:25.802 --> 06:26.969
Kuze.

06:27.804 --> 06:29.972
<i>She is the one who,
being of the dead,</i>

06:29.972 --> 06:33.309
<i>can adapt to the immense
weight and speed of a steed</i>

06:33.309 --> 06:35.478
<i>that devastates the terrain.</i>

06:36.145 --> 06:38.231
<i>The one who possesses lethal,</i>

06:38.231 --> 06:43.486
<i>long-range weapons that can cut through
armies in a single sweep.</i>

06:46.030 --> 06:50.952
<i>The one with both armor
that blocks all common attacks</i>

06:50.952 --> 06:54.789
<i>and an undying nature
that cannot be stopped.</i>

07:03.923 --> 07:06.843
<i>It was given two bodies,</i>

07:07.427 --> 07:10.930
<i>yet this fierce war steed
was sought only for the singular function</i>

07:11.431 --> 07:14.100
<i>of destroying everything in sight.</i>

07:19.230 --> 07:24.735
<i>She is a Cataphract. She is a revenant.
She is Nihilo the Vortical Stampede.</i>

07:39.667 --> 07:41.461
Star... Runner.

07:41.461 --> 07:45.214
<i>Moved... To Lithia...</i>

07:45.214 --> 07:49.302
Thanks to him
not appearing right here in Lithia,

07:49.302 --> 07:51.596
we got a grasp on most of his magic items.

07:51.596 --> 07:54.682
To think he'd show his hand so carelessly.

07:54.682 --> 07:57.018
He truly is hopeless.

07:58.227 --> 07:59.729
Listen up, bird brains!

08:00.938 --> 08:02.356
Listen!

08:02.356 --> 08:05.026
Alus' greatest attack

08:05.026 --> 08:07.528
is Hillensingen the Luminous Blade.

08:08.112 --> 08:10.865
It fires out a blade of light
the moment it's drawn.

08:10.865 --> 08:14.368
I've had reports that
it extends up to four meters.

08:14.368 --> 08:17.121
Don't waste time guarding against this.

08:17.121 --> 08:20.625
A direct hit would kill you anyway.

08:20.625 --> 08:23.753
His other enchanted sword
is called Trembling Bird.

08:24.504 --> 08:26.506
<i>It's a sword
that flies around on its own,</i>

08:26.506 --> 08:28.090
<i>letting out a loud noise as it goes.</i>

08:28.090 --> 08:30.635
<i>Treat it like
there's another enemy in play.</i>

08:31.761 --> 08:35.056
I've assigned a separate unit
to keep this sword in check.

08:35.056 --> 08:38.518
That's not all. He has an enchanted whip
called Kio's Hand.

08:39.101 --> 08:41.854
<i>It extends up to 12 meters
or even more.</i>

08:41.854 --> 08:43.022
<i>However,</i>

08:43.022 --> 08:47.401
<i>he sometimes uses it
as a protective barrier around himself.</i>

08:47.985 --> 08:50.738
This is an attack
you should watch out for.

08:50.738 --> 08:53.282
When he does this, the attack range
falls to less than half.

08:53.282 --> 08:56.452
Now repeat after me scum, 12 meters!

08:56.452 --> 08:58.120
Twelve... meters...

08:58.120 --> 09:00.414
Don't... get close...

09:00.998 --> 09:02.250
Have you all remembered that?

09:02.250 --> 09:05.086
His main weapon, a gun,
has a range beyond that.

09:05.086 --> 09:06.671
He has poison magic bullets

09:06.671 --> 09:08.756
that will turn you to sludge
with just a graze,

09:08.756 --> 09:10.299
as well as thunderclap magic bullets.

09:10.883 --> 09:12.885
You can stop him from firing

09:12.885 --> 09:15.555
by disrupting his shooting stance
and stopping him from reloading.

09:16.138 --> 09:18.641
Disruption should take place
from beyond 12 meters.

09:18.641 --> 09:22.687
Those in sacrificial roles, disrupt him
together from beyond a six-meter radius.

09:22.687 --> 09:26.274
Roger... that...

09:27.984 --> 09:30.486
Attack the... Star Runner!

09:35.283 --> 09:38.119
<i>Wyverns need no champion.</i>

09:39.036 --> 09:41.872
<i>I will end this here and now.</i>

09:43.040 --> 09:46.961
Ishura
Revenant

10:05.396 --> 10:07.815
I've not seen that face in a while.

10:07.815 --> 10:10.401
You've been running away for so long,

10:10.401 --> 10:12.445
Three-Armed Alus.

10:14.822 --> 10:17.450
So you've finally
come home to the swarm.

10:18.034 --> 10:22.455
We even welcome trash like you
here in my swarm.

10:22.455 --> 10:25.541
You can be in charge of procuring food
if you like.

10:27.084 --> 10:28.502
Shut up already.

10:35.343 --> 10:37.094
Don't tell me you're angry.

10:37.094 --> 10:39.263
Surely not.

10:39.263 --> 10:42.391
You don't possess the brains
required for getting angry.

10:42.391 --> 10:46.395
You crawl around on the ground
and can hardly ride the wind.

10:46.395 --> 10:48.606
A three-armed fool.

10:48.606 --> 10:50.107
That's all you are!

11:11.295 --> 11:13.964
A clumsy response, as expected.

11:13.964 --> 11:17.218
Can you guess why I've been
waiting for you here in Lithia?

11:27.019 --> 11:28.896
Using a gun oneself.

11:28.896 --> 11:32.525
Only a fool would do that, right, Alus?

11:35.945 --> 11:39.115
<i>It's a trap.
If I stop, I'll be shot down.</i>

11:39.115 --> 11:41.325
<i>A weapon I could use from this range is...</i>

11:41.325 --> 11:43.661
From Regnejee to the wind of Lithia.
Reversing Mirror Disk.

11:43.661 --> 11:44.829
String-tethered sun.

11:44.829 --> 11:45.955
Illuminate!

11:50.418 --> 11:52.169
How irritating.

11:55.423 --> 11:57.967
<i>He took a calculated hit.</i>

11:57.967 --> 11:59.301
Trembling Bird.

12:06.767 --> 12:07.768
Kio's...

12:11.981 --> 12:14.400
From Regnejee to the wind of Lithia.
Reversing Mirror Disk.

12:14.400 --> 12:15.568
String-tethered sun.

12:15.568 --> 12:16.652
Illuminate!

12:23.492 --> 12:28.664
I've already prepared countermeasures
for Kio's Hand and your Luminous Blade.

12:28.664 --> 12:31.667
That arm of yours is just dead weight now.

12:34.420 --> 12:37.423
Alus. Three-Armed Alus!

12:39.091 --> 12:42.011
Let me guess what you're thinking.

12:42.011 --> 12:46.015
You wish you could get your hands
on the Cold Star.

12:46.015 --> 12:48.184
Do you long for it?

12:49.018 --> 12:52.938
That's if your heart
is even capable of such a feeling.

12:53.689 --> 12:55.441
The Cold Star, huh?

12:55.441 --> 12:57.067
I don't need such a thing

12:57.693 --> 12:59.612
to destroy a country.

13:02.573 --> 13:03.574
Ground Runner.

13:21.258 --> 13:22.927
<i>Only the streets are burning.</i>

13:22.927 --> 13:26.597
<i>It's not even a military facility...
A pointless attack.</i>

13:26.597 --> 13:27.973
<i>What about Curte?</i>

13:28.766 --> 13:30.935
<i>The fire hasn't reached Curte.</i>

13:31.519 --> 13:34.647
<i>Only those minian citizens will perish.</i>

13:45.616 --> 13:47.201
Sixteen meters!

13:48.410 --> 13:51.163
I knew you'd been
keeping your full range secret.

13:52.248 --> 13:54.792
It didn't make any difference though.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.503
Just what are they?

13:58.629 --> 14:01.841
They're different from your average swarm!

14:01.841 --> 14:03.676
They're not wyverns...

14:05.427 --> 14:08.180
It took less than four years
to rebuild my swarm

14:08.180 --> 14:11.016
that got destroyed by the True Demon King.

14:11.016 --> 14:12.852
Want to know how I did it?

14:14.019 --> 14:16.772
I've altered their minds with Life Arts.

14:16.772 --> 14:18.440
And I'll do the same to yours.

14:19.316 --> 14:20.442
That's a lie.

14:20.442 --> 14:22.820
Such a thing
is not possible with Life Arts.

14:23.404 --> 14:27.157
Have you started talking
to buy yourself time?

14:27.157 --> 14:29.410
Three-Armed Alus!

14:31.120 --> 14:35.374
The more time passes,
the more obvious your defeat appears.

14:42.131 --> 14:44.216
This is the New Principality.

14:44.216 --> 14:47.511
I can mobilize
as many minian snipers as I please.

14:48.095 --> 14:49.513
From the moment you arrived,

14:49.513 --> 14:52.933
they've been gathering
in this district, slowpoke!

14:54.393 --> 14:58.022
You've always talked a lot, Regnejee.

14:58.022 --> 14:59.940
That's right!

14:59.940 --> 15:02.693
Repent now. Admit defeat.

15:02.693 --> 15:04.778
I'm talking to give you that chance.

15:04.778 --> 15:08.741
I'm trying to get you to understand
just how much of a mistaken,

15:08.741 --> 15:10.534
useless piece of trash you are.

15:11.076 --> 15:13.913
Think carefully now, Alus!

15:13.913 --> 15:17.082
My tactics have beaten yours!

15:27.551 --> 15:28.552
<i>Right...</i>

15:29.261 --> 15:30.596
<i>Time...</i>

15:31.889 --> 15:33.557
<i>I needed more time.</i>

15:36.101 --> 15:37.102
He's finished.

15:49.573 --> 15:51.659
I'm the one who was right.

15:56.997 --> 15:59.917
All soldiers descend! Pursue him!

15:59.917 --> 16:03.671
Assume enemy survival
and surround Alus the Star Runner!

16:03.671 --> 16:05.756
Once you find him, don't let him escape.

16:05.756 --> 16:08.676
Even if it costs your lives!

16:08.676 --> 16:11.679
Our lives...

16:11.679 --> 16:14.306
Surround... Roger that...

16:14.306 --> 16:17.810
Stop repeating what I said
and get going, scum!

16:20.020 --> 16:21.689
<i>For some reason,</i>

16:22.523 --> 16:25.025
<i>no blood was spilled
when those bullets hit him just now.</i>

16:26.568 --> 16:31.323
<i>Suppose his every move
since releasing the flames had a reason...</i>

16:32.408 --> 16:35.077
<i>That means he plans to fly low!</i>

16:38.080 --> 16:39.832
Greatshield of the Dead.

16:49.591 --> 16:51.176
I found him!

16:51.176 --> 16:53.762
I found Alus the Star Runner!

16:53.762 --> 16:57.266
Executing... follow-up attack!

17:01.228 --> 17:03.230
These guys really creep me out.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.115
Where is he?
Keep going down!

17:13.782 --> 17:16.326
Darn. We can't see a thing with this fire.

17:19.288 --> 17:21.331
<i>Consider the problem
and take measures.</i>

17:25.961 --> 17:29.256
<i>That's right, take measures.</i>

17:31.467 --> 17:35.012
I never ran away from the swarm like you.

17:37.514 --> 17:39.141
I won't let you run anymore.

17:39.725 --> 17:43.145
You will be killed
by the very swarm you ran from!

17:43.145 --> 17:45.189
You sound like you wanted to run away too.

17:45.731 --> 17:48.650
You know,
one usually runs away from enemies.

17:48.650 --> 17:52.905
Which means you considered
your own swarm to be your enemy.

17:52.905 --> 17:55.824
Trash! Burn and die here!

17:55.824 --> 17:57.659
Three-Armed Alus!

17:58.744 --> 18:00.037
Explosives?

18:13.092 --> 18:15.761
These guys are insane.

18:15.761 --> 18:17.888
They have no freedom at all.

18:18.555 --> 18:20.349
Such creatures are not wyverns.

18:22.309 --> 18:23.560
That's right!

18:23.560 --> 18:25.938
They are no longer wyverns!

18:29.733 --> 18:33.529
From Regnejee to the wings of Eupa.
Dizzying dome, glistening golden shards.

18:33.529 --> 18:34.655
Unravel!

18:37.741 --> 18:38.826
Fool!

18:38.826 --> 18:41.203
You're a helpless fool!

18:41.787 --> 18:45.124
Do you really think it was your own
determination that brought you this far?

18:46.792 --> 18:48.460
Scissor beetles.

18:48.460 --> 18:50.587
Insects I control with my Life Arts.

18:50.587 --> 18:54.216
They're attracted
to the smell of smoke on you.

18:54.925 --> 18:56.176
In Mage City,

18:56.176 --> 18:59.096
you burned quite a few
of my soldiers, didn't you?

19:00.264 --> 19:02.349
You inhaled smoke from the pots.

19:02.349 --> 19:05.727
Smoke from the self-destructing wyverns
has attached to your respiratory system.

19:05.727 --> 19:08.689
The position I cornered you in
with the self-destruct attacks

19:08.689 --> 19:11.358
is a hunting ground
surrounded by beetle nests!

19:11.942 --> 19:16.947
Everything you thought of,
every single thing from the very start,

19:16.947 --> 19:20.534
was all included in my tactical planning.

19:20.534 --> 19:22.703
What do you think will happen now?

19:22.703 --> 19:25.038
The beetles will eat through
your palate and nostrils,

19:25.038 --> 19:27.958
and ravage the part of the brain
that controls free will.

19:29.501 --> 19:33.172
Shall I guess what you're thinking now?

19:33.839 --> 19:35.174
Guess...

19:35.174 --> 19:37.176
what I'm thinking...

19:37.176 --> 19:40.262
"He's come to the front of the swarm."

19:40.262 --> 19:42.598
"I'll use the last of my strength

19:42.598 --> 19:44.766
to attack suddenly
and take down the commander."

19:44.766 --> 19:46.268
Attack...

19:46.268 --> 19:48.645
You'll wave your Luminous Blade around.

19:56.236 --> 19:57.404
Measures...

19:57.404 --> 20:00.157
Consider the problem, and take measures.

20:00.157 --> 20:03.577
From Regnejee to the wings of Eupa.
Dizzying dome, glistening golden shards.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.661
Unravel.

20:15.672 --> 20:18.175
Your life was meaningless.

20:18.175 --> 20:20.928
Including the treasures
and fame you gathered.

20:21.762 --> 20:24.014
Do you know of singing?

20:24.014 --> 20:26.934
I found a true treasure.

20:26.934 --> 20:28.310
Greater than you ever found.

20:30.479 --> 20:31.897
I thought so.

20:31.897 --> 20:32.981
Huh?

20:33.482 --> 20:35.400
To the top...

20:36.652 --> 20:37.903
What now?

20:37.903 --> 20:40.239
Don't you know I've beaten you?

20:40.239 --> 20:42.824
I thought you'd run to the top.

20:50.582 --> 20:55.087
<i>If he had been
controlling the flames this whole time...</i>

21:11.103 --> 21:12.104
Ground Runner.

21:25.534 --> 21:28.370
You spoke too much, Regnejee.

21:31.873 --> 21:35.127
Had you kept silent,
you'd have posed more of a challenge.

21:48.640 --> 21:49.641
Hm?

22:03.113 --> 22:04.448
This is goodbye.

23:36.623 --> 23:38.625
Translated by Zacarias Hicks

23:39.334 --> 23:40.961
Episode 10
Vanishing Calamity
